# Personal tokens for the curator MCP endpoint (amira-mcp-curator).
# Template only: copy it to deploy/amira/curator-secrets/tokens, mode 0600.
# The copy is gitignored; CI rejects any line here that is not a comment. See
# deploy/amira/README.md#curator-mcp-endpoint.
#
# One line per curator: a name (what the audit log prints) and the SHA-256 of
# their token, never the token itself. Generate both with
#   docker compose run --rm --no-deps amira-mcp-curator node server/tokenCli.js <name>
# and paste the line it prints. The server re-reads this file every 2 s at
# most: deleting a line revokes that curator, with no restart.
#
# alice <64 hex characters printed by tokenCli>
